abstract: >
  A documentary study of the interface between safety assurance and formal
  verification in NASA Gateway autonomous systems, identifying a traceability
  gap in public documentation. Version 1.1.0 adds the Phase II Independent
  Evidence Review, consolidating four sub-phases (II-bis, II-ter, II-quater,
  II-quinquies) and documenting three resolved contradictions without
  modifying any project code.

